<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25153" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαλλ-ᾰγή</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαλλάσσω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>interchange,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς διαλλαγὰς ἔχοιμεν ἀλλήλοισιν ὧν
					πένοιτο γῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					209
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>change,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυναστειῶν, ἀρχόντων,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				47.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				48.53
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀριθμοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.D.
					<u>Synt.</u>
					259.25
				</span></i>
			: but esp. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>change</i> from enmity <i>to friendship, reconciliation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Is.
				7.44
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δ.</span> personified, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				989
			</span></i>: in pl., <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				375
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				472
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαλλαγαὶ πρός τινα</span>
				lsoc.<i><span class="en">
				4.94
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				2.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>difference,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Isoc.</u>
				11
			</span></i>.</div>
